# Project update authored as Markdown.
output = ARGV.len() > 0 ? ARGV[0] : "markdown-project-deck.pptx"; let body = """# Project Atlas

**Delivery update** for the leadership team.

- Platform foundation is complete
  - Native Office output is validated
- Customer pilot starts in June

Note: Confirm pilot owners before the next review.

---

# Release plan

{{layout: two-column}}

The pilot has two gates: an agreed owner for each milestone and a customer-ready support plan.

| Milestone | Owner | Status |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Beta | Maya Chen | Ready |
| Pilot | Rowan Price | June |

---

# Decisions

The team will ship the focused workflow first, then expand integrations after pilot feedback.
""";
# host dependency: cli="lmoffice pptx" install="github:lmctl-ai/lmoffice@v0.1.58"
schema_p = load_schema(schema="../schema/pptx.dsl.json");
p = _lmcode_ schema_p;
let d=pptx.create(${output}); d.markdown(${body}).save();
end _lmcode_
r = run_lmcode(p, {command:["lmoffice","pptx","--lmcode","$DSLFILE"]}); assert(r.ok);
